<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>DAO Collective</title>
    <style>
      :root {
        --bg: #06131d;
        --bg-2: #0d1f2e;
        --panel: rgba(15, 25, 38, 0.9);
        --text: #edf6ff;
        --muted: #a7bbca;
        --primary: #5eead4;
        --secondary: #8b5cf6;
        --gold: #fbbf24;
        --border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
        --shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
      }

      * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }

      html {
        scroll-behavior: smooth;
      }

      body {
        margin: 0;
        font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
        background: radial-gradient(circle at top, #12314c 0%, var(--bg) 35%, #040b12 100%);
        color: var(--text);
        line-height: 1.6;
      }

      a {
        text-decoration: none;
        color: inherit;
      }

      .container {
        width: min(1120px, calc(100% - 32px));
        margin: 0 auto;
      }

      header {
        position: sticky;
        top: 0;
        z-index: 10;
        background: rgba(6, 19, 29, 0.7);
        backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      }

      .nav {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        min-height: 72px;
      }

      .brand {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 12px;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      }

      .brand-mark {
        width: 34px;
        height: 34px;
        border-radius: 10px;
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        font-weight: 800;
        color: #06131d;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), #a7f3d0);
      }

      .nav-links {
        display: flex;
        gap: 28px;
        color: var(--muted);
      }

      .nav-links a:hover {
        color: var(--text);
      }

      .btn {
        display: inline-block;
        padding: 14px 22px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        font-weight: 700;
        transition: 0.2s ease;
        border: 1px solid transparent;
      }

      .btn:hover {
        transform: translateY(-1px);
        box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      }

      .btn-primary {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), #8ef1d7);
        color: #062b36;
      }

      .btn-secondary {
        border-color: var(--border);
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
        color: var(--text);
      }

      .hero {
        padding: 90px 0 70px;
      }

      .hero-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.8fr;
        gap: 42px;
        align-items: center;
      }

      .eyebrow {
        display: inline-block;
        padding: 8px 14px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        background: rgba(94, 234, 212, 0.08);
        color: var(--primary);
        border: 1px solid rgba(94, 234, 212, 0.2);
        font-size: 0.72rem;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.1em;
        font-weight: 700;
      }

      h1 {
        font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 5vw, 5rem);
        line-height: 1.05;
        letter-spacing: -0.06em;
        margin: 20px 0 18px;
      }

      .hero p {
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 1.08rem;
        max-width: 640px;
      }

      .hero-actions {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 16px;
        margin-top: 30px;
      }

      .stats {
        display: flex;
        gap: 28px;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        margin-top: 36px;
      }

      .stats div {
        min-width: 120px;
      }

      .stats strong {
        display: block;
        font-size: 1.8rem;
        line-height: 1;
      }

      .stats span {
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.9rem;
      }

      .card {
        background: var(--panel);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 24px;
        box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      }

      .dashboard {
        padding: 22px;
        background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(19, 38, 58, 0.92), rgba(7, 19, 31, 0.95));
      }

      .mini-header {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        margin-bottom: 22px;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.8rem;
      }

      .dot-group {
        display: flex;
        gap: 8px;
      }

      .dot {
        width: 10px;
        height: 10px;
        border-radius: 50%;
      }

      .dot:nth-child(1) { background: #ff5f56; }
      .dot:nth-child(2) { background: #ffbd2e; }
      .dot:nth-child(3) { background: #27c93f; }

      .token-box {
        padding: 16px 18px;
        border-radius: 18px;
        border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(94,234,212,0.08), rgba(139,92,246,0.12));
      }

      .token-box small {
        display: block;
        color: var(--muted);
        margin-bottom: 8px;
      }

      .balance {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        margin: 8px 0 18px;
        gap: 12px;
      }

      .balance strong {
        font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 2.8rem);
        letter-spacing: -0.06em;
      }

      .pill {
        background: rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.12);
        color: var(--gold);
        border: 1px solid rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.25);
        border-radius: 999px;
        padding: 7px 10px;
        font-size: 0.72rem;
        font-weight: 700;
      }

      .list {
        display: grid;
        gap: 12px;
        margin-top: 18px;
      }

      .list-row {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 16px;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
        border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
        border-radius: 12px;
        padding: 12px 14px;
      }

      .list-row span {
        color: var(--muted);
      }

      .list-row strong {
        font-size: 0.96rem;
      }

      section {
        padding: 50px 0;
      }

      .section-heading {
        text-align: center;
        margin-bottom: 30px;
      }

      .section-heading h2 {
        margin: 0 0 10px;
        font-size: clamp(2rem, 3vw, 2.8rem);
        letter-spacing: -0.05em;
      }

      .section-heading p {
        margin: 0;
        color: var(--muted);
      }

      .feature-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
        gap: 20px;
      }

      .feature {
        padding: 26px 22px;
      }

      .feature-icon {
        width: 52px;
        height: 52px;
        border-radius: 14px;
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        margin-bottom: 18px;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(94,234,212,0.16), rgba(139,92,246,0.18));
        border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
        font-size: 1.4rem;
      }

      .feature h3 {
        margin: 0 0 10px;
        font-size: 1.2rem;
      }

      .feature p {
        margin: 0;
        color: var(--muted);
      }

      .cta {
        padding: 60px 0 100px;
      }

      .cta-box {
        text-align: center;
        padding: 40px 24px;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(94,234,212,0.08), rgba(139,92,246,0.12));
      }

      .cta-box h3 {
        margin: 0 0 12px;
        font-size: clamp(2rem, 3vw, 3rem);
        letter-spacing: -0.05em;
      }

      .cta-box p {
        margin: 0 0 24px;
        color: var(--muted);
      }

      @media (max-width: 860px) {
        .hero-grid,
        .feature-grid {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }

        .nav-links {
          display: none;
        }

        .hero {
          padding-top: 60px;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header>
      <div class="container nav">
        <div class="brand">
          <div class="brand-mark">D</div>
          DAO Collective
        </div>

        <nav class="nav-links" aria-label="Main navigation">
          <a href="#about">About</a>
          <a href="#features">Features</a>
          <a href="#governance">Governance</a>
          <a href="#community">Community</a>
        </nav>

        <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="#join">Join DAO</a>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="hero">
        <div class="container hero-grid">
          <div>
            <span class="eyebrow">On-chain governance</span>
            <h1>Build the future together.</h1>
            <p>
              DAO Collective helps communities coordinate decisions, fund ideas,
              and grow value through transparent decentralized governance.
            </p>

            <div class="hero-actions">
              <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#join">Launch Proposal</a>
              <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="#about">Learn More</a>
            </div>

            <div class="stats">
              <div>
                <strong>$28.4M</strong>
                <span>treasury</span>
              </div>
              <div>
                <strong>1,240</strong>
                <span>members</span>
              </div>
              <div>
                <strong>96%</strong>
                <span>turnout</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="card dashboard" aria-label="DAO dashboard preview">
            <div class="mini-header">
              <span>Governance Dashboard</span>
              <div class="dot-group" aria-hidden="true">
                <span class="dot"></span>
                <span class="dot"></span>
                <span class="dot"></span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="token-box">
              <small>Community treasury</small>
              <div class="balance">
                <strong>245,890</strong>
                <span class="pill">+12.8%</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="list">
              <div class="list-row">
                <span>Proposal 24</span>
                <strong>Infrastructure grant</strong>
              </div>
              <div class="list-row">
                <span>Proposal 25</span>
                <strong>Community rewards</strong>
              </div>
              <div class="list-row">
                <span>Proposal 26</span>
                <strong>Partnership expansion</strong>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="features">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="section-heading">
            <h2>Why communities choose us</h2>
            <p>Built for transparent coordination, funding, and shared ownership.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="feature-grid">
            <article class="feature card">
              <div class="feature-icon">⚙️</div>
              <h3>Smart Governance</h3>
              <p>Set voting rules, delegation, and treasury management with secure on-chain controls.</p>
            </article>

            <article class="feature card">
              <div class="feature-icon">💸</div>
              <h3>Funding Pools</h3>
              <p>Distribute grants and incentives to builders, creators, and contributors with transparency.</p>
            </article>

            <article class="feature card">
              <div class="feature-icon">🌍</div>
              <h3>Global Community</h3>
              <p>Unite members from around the world around shared goals and collective action.</p>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="about">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="section-heading">
            <h2>Transparent, democratic, and resilient</h2>
            <p>Every decision is visible, every proposal is accountable, and every member can participate.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="cta" id="join">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="card cta-box">
            <h3>Join the next wave of collective ownership.</h3>
            <p>Shape the ecosystem, vote on proposals, and help steer the future of the DAO.</p>
            <a class="btn btn-primary" href="mailto:hello@daocollective.io">Become a Member</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
